{"v":1,"book":"gita","n":18,"title":"Attaining liberation by giving up ego","narrator":{"name":"Sonia","voice":"en-GB-SoniaNeural"},"duration":545.832,"scenes":[{"layout":"title","headline":"Liberation by Giving Up Ego","visual":["The whole Gita, gathered together"],"L":[],"say":"Chapter Eighteen. Attaining Liberation by Giving Up Ego. The longest chapter, and the last. Here Krishna gathers the whole Gita together.","start":0.0,"at":0.576,"end":11.688,"words":[[0.1,0.55,"Chapter"],[0.662,0.675,"Eighteen"],[1.738,0.512,"Attaining"],[2.263,0.775,"Liberation"],[3.05,0.163,"by"],[3.225,0.35,"Giving"],[3.587,0.163,"Up"],[3.763,0.487,"Ego"],[4.65,0.087,"The"],[4.75,0.487,"longest"],[5.25,0.512,"chapter"],[5.987,0.125,"and"],[6.125,0.087,"the"],[6.225,0.613,"last"],[7.225,0.225,"Here"],[7.463,0.55,"Krishna"],[8.025,0.45,"gathers"],[8.488,0.1,"the"],[8.6,0.275,"whole"],[8.887,0.4,"Gita"],[9.3,0.575,"together"]]},{"layout":"verse","headline":"","visual":[],"L":["L1"],"ref":"18.02","verse":"The Supreme Lord said: The sages call renunciation the complete renunciation of work for any personal profit. The wise define sacrifice as the sacrifice of, and the freedom from, attachment to the fruits of all work.","key":true,"vs":[15,51],"say":"Arjuna asks one more question: what is the difference between renunciation and sacrifice? Verse two. The Supreme Lord said: The sages call renunciation the complete renunciation of work for any personal profit. The wise define sacrifice as the sacrifice of, and the freedom from, attachment to the fruits of all work.","start":11.688,"at":12.264,"end":34.992,"words":[[0.138,0.6,"Arjuna"],[0.75,0.375,"asks"],[1.137,0.225,"one"],[1.375,0.175,"more"],[1.562,0.575,"question"],[2.487,0.163,"what"],[2.663,0.113,"is"],[2.788,0.1,"the"],[2.9,0.45,"difference"],[3.362,0.35,"between"],[3.725,0.9,"renunciation"],[4.638,0.163,"and"],[4.812,0.887,"sacrifice"],[6.062,0.45,"Verse"],[6.525,0.438,"two"],[7.362,0.113,"The"],[7.487,0.463,"Supreme"],[7.963,0.25,"Lord