shipping the Supreme Being—from whom all beings originate, and by whom all this universe is pervaded — through performance of one’s natural duty for Him.","key":true,"vs":[19,48],"say":"And the work we do in the world, done well and offered to God, is itself worship. Verse forty-six. One attains perfection by worshipping the Supreme Being—from whom all beings originate, and by whom all this universe is pervaded — through performance of one’s natural duty for Him.","start":124.128,"at":124.704,"end":143.328,"words":[[0.138,0.113,"And"],[0.263,0.087,"the"],[0.362,0.287,"work"],[0.662,0.113,"we"],[0.787,0.163,"do"],[0.963,0.1,"in"],[1.075,0.087,"the"],[1.175,0.463,"world"],[1.85,0.225,"done"],[2.087,0.325,"well"],[2.425,0.125,"and"],[2.562,0.275,"offered"],[2.85,0.087,"to"],[2.95,0.362,"God"],[3.575,0.1,"is"],[3.688,0.475,"itself"],[4.175,0.65,"worship"],[5.188,0.425,"Verse"],[5.625,0.95,"forty-six"],[6.938,0.287,"One"],[7.237,0.4,"attains"],[7.65,0.613,"perfection"],[8.275,0.15,"by"],[8.438,0.55,"worshipping"],[9.0,0.087,"the"],[9.1,0.487,"Supreme"],[9.6,0.375,"Being"],[10.075,0.175,"from"],[10.262,0.225,"whom"],[10.5,0.212,"all"],[10.725,0.3,"beings"],[11.037,0.6,"originate"],[11.963,0.1,"and"],[12.075,0.15,"by"],[12.238,0.237,"whom"],[12.488,0.188,"all"],[12.688,0.188,"this"],[12.887,0.525,"universe"],[13.425,0.138,"is"],[13.575,0.6,"pervaded"],[14.287,0.188,"through"],[14.488,0.625,"performance"],[15.125,0.1,"of"],[15.238,0.312,"one’s"],[15.562,0.412,"natural"],[15.988,0.325,"duty"],[16.325,0.125,"for"],[16.462,0.338,"Him"]]},{"layout":"verse","headline":"","visual":[],"L":["L8"],"ref":"18.61","verse":"The Supreme Lord, Krishna or God, abiding as the controller in the inner psyche of all beings, O Arjuna, causes them to evolve — or work out their Karma — like a puppet of Karma, mounted on a machine.","key":true,"vs":[25,64],"say":"Krishna then speaks about karma and free will. Arjuna's own nature, he says, will make him fight, even if he resolves not to. Verse sixt