rieve"]]},{"layout":"verse","headline":"","visual":[],"L":[],"ref":"18.73","verse":"Arjuna said: By Your Grace my delusion is destroyed; I have gained Self-knowledge; my confusion with regard to body and Spirit is dispelled; and I shall obey Your command.","key":false,"vs":[13,42],"say":"Krishna asks: has your delusion been destroyed, Arjuna? And Arjuna answers. Verse seventy-three. Arjuna said: By Your Grace my delusion is destroyed; I have gained Self-knowledge; my confusion with regard to body and Spirit is dispelled; and I shall obey Your command.","start":223.992,"at":224.568,"end":244.344,"words":[[0.113,0.463,"Krishna"],[0.588,0.525,"asks"],[1.438,0.15,"has"],[1.6,0.113,"your"],[1.725,0.562,"delusion"],[2.3,0.175,"been"],[2.487,0.613,"destroyed"],[3.312,0.562,"Arjuna"],[4.275,0.163,"And"],[4.45,0.512,"Arjuna"],[4.975,0.725,"answers"],[6.075,0.375,"Verse"],[6.463,0.963,"seventy-three"],[7.825,0.5,"Arjuna"],[8.338,0.362,"said"],[8.988,0.15,"By"],[9.15,0.2,"Your"],[9.363,0.375,"Grace"],[9.75,0.125,"my"],[9.887,0.562,"delusion"],[10.463,0.125,"is"],[10.6,0.613,"destroyed"],[11.525,0.075,"I"],[11.613,0.175,"have"],[11.8,0.287,"gained"],[12.1,0.775,"Self-knowledge"],[13.137,0.15,"my"],[13.3,0.562,"confusion"],[13.875,0.15,"with"],[14.037,0.4,"regard"],[14.45,0.087,"to"],[14.55,0.325,"body"],[14.887,0.1,"and"],[15.0,0.438,"Spirit"],[15.45,0.113,"is"],[15.575,0.562,"dispelled"],[16.425,0.113,"and"],[16.55,0.087,"I"],[16.65,0.212,"shall"],[16.875,0.287,"obey"],[17.175,0.163,"Your"],[17.35,0.613,"command"]]},{"layout":"story","headline":"Sanjaya's joy","visual":["Sanjaya has heard every word","His hair stands on end","He rejoices again and again"],"L":[],"say":"Far away, in the palace, Sanjaya finishes his report to the blind king. By the grace of the sage Vyasa, he says, I heard this wonderful dialogue with my own ears. Every time I remember it, I am thrilled, and every time I recall that marvellous form of Krishna, I rejoice again and again.","start":244.344,"at":244