still"],[17.825,0.575,"choosing"]]},{"layout":"lesson","headline":"Surrender to God Is the Ultimate Path","visual":["Set aside doership and ownership","Surrender to God's will","\"I shall liberate you. Do not grieve.\""],"L":["L9"],"say":"Lesson nine. Surrender to God is the ultimate path. Set aside the sense of being the doer and the owner, offer every action with love, and take refuge in God's will. And God makes a promise: I shall free you from all bondage. Do not grieve.","start":482.736,"at":483.312,"end":500.664,"words":[[0.125,0.438,"Lesson"],[0.575,0.487,"nine"],[1.438,0.575,"Surrender"],[2.025,0.125,"to"],[2.163,0.375,"God"],[2.55,0.163,"is"],[2.725,0.15,"the"],[2.888,0.512,"ultimate"],[3.413,0.55,"path"],[4.35,0.287,"Set"],[4.65,0.425,"aside"],[5.088,0.1,"the"],[5.2,0.325,"sense"],[5.537,0.125,"of"],[5.675,0.225,"being"],[5.912,0.113,"the"],[6.037,0.287,"doer"],[6.338,0.15,"and"],[6.5,0.138,"the"],[6.65,0.388,"owner"],[7.3,0.275,"offer"],[7.588,0.325,"every"],[7.925,0.388,"action"],[8.325,0.15,"with"],[8.488,0.362,"love"],[9.125,0.087,"and"],[9.225,0.25,"take"],[9.488,0.45,"refuge"],[9.95,0.113,"in"],[10.075,0.3,"God's"],[10.387,0.375,"will"],[11.162,0.15,"And"],[11.325,0.287,"God"],[11.625,0.25,"makes"],[11.887,0.062,"a"],[11.963,0.55,"promise"],[12.825,0.087,"I"],[12.925,0.212,"shall"],[13.15,0.287,"free"],[13.45,0.188,"you"],[13.65,0.225,"from"],[13.887,0.2,"all"],[14.1,0.637,"bondage"],[15.1,0.188,"Do"],[15.3,0.263,"not"],[15.575,0.55,"grieve"]]},{"layout":"compare","headline":"Wisdom and action, together","visual":["Krishna | Arjuna","The Lord of yoga | The bow of duty","Wisdom and dharma | Courage and action","Together: victory and peace | Together: lasting prosperity"],"L":["L10"],"say":"Lesson ten. Both knowledge and devoted action are required for liberation. The Gita ends where Krishna and Arjuna stand together: the wisdom of dharma and the bow of duty. Knowledge alone is not enough, and neither is action alone. Where both are united, there is victory, prosperity and peace.","start":500.664,"at":501.24,"end":522.312,"words":[[0.138,0.45,"Lesson"],[0.6,0.487,"ten"],[1.462,0.3,"Both"],[1.775,0.512,"knowledge"],[2.3,0.125,"and"],[2.438,0.487,"devoted"],[2.938,0.55,"action"],[3.5,0.087,"are"],[3.6,0.625,"required"],[4.237,0.113,"for"],[4.362,0.8,"liberation"],[5.562,0.125,"The"],[5.7,0.438,"Gita"],[6.15,0.338,"ends"],[6.5,0.15,"where"],[6.662,0.525,"Krishna"],[7.2,0.163,"and"],[7.375,0.5,"Arjuna"],[7.888,0.35,"stand"],[8.25,0.45,"together"],[9.012,0.075,"the"],[9.1,0.362,"wisdom"],[9.475,0.125,"of"],[9.613,0.463,"dharma"],[10.088,0.15,"and"],[10.25,0.1,"the"],[10.363,0.2,"bow"],[10.575,0.125,"of"],[10.713,0.475,"duty"],[11.588,0.388,"Knowledge"],[11.988,0.425,"alone"],[12.425,0.15,"is"],[12.588,0.212,"not"],[12.812,0.45,"enough"],[13.55,0.125,"and"],[13.688,0.425,"neither"],[14.125,0.15,"is"],[14.287,0.375,"action"],[14.675,0.487,"alone"],[15.562,0.2,"Where"],[15.775,0.338,"both"],[16.125,0.025,"are"],[16.163,0.688,"united"],[17.113,0.125,"there"],[17.25,0.175,"is"],[17.438,0.562,"victory"],[18.212,0.8,"prosperity"],[19.1,0.163,"and"],[19.275,0.562,"peace"]]},{"layout":"closing","headline":"Rise, and act with love","visual":["Give up the ego, not the work","Offer everything; surrender to God","Knowledge and action, together"],"L":[],"say":"So, Chapter Eighteen, and the whole Gita. Give up the ego, not the work. Offer every action to God, and take refuge in him. Let knowledge and action walk together, like Krishna and Arjuna in one chariot. Arjuna's confusion is gone. Now he stands up, and so can we. Thank you for watching Shruti.","start":522.312,"at":522.888,"end":545.832,"words":[[0.125,0.45,"So"],[0.825,0.412,"Chapter"],[1.25,0.6,"Eighteen"],[2.062,0.113,"and"],[2.188,0.075,"the"],[2.275,0.25,"whole"],[2.538,0.512,"Gita"],[3.413,0.225,"Give"],[3.65,0.163,"up"],[3.825,0.113,"the"],[3.95,0.487,"ego"],[4.688,0.225,"not"],[4.925,0.087,"the"],[5.025,0.537,"work"],[5.963,0.375,"Offer"],[6.35,0.35,"every"],[6.713,0